33:30.257 --> 33:30.858
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh, yeah.

33:30.878 --> 33:31.799
[SPEAKER_00]: What was it?

33:32.660 --> 33:34.222
[SPEAKER_00]: As a, as a sakyong or something like that.

33:34.242 --> 33:35.023
[SPEAKER_00]: Sakyong or something like that.

33:35.063 --> 33:35.444
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, yes.

33:35.464 --> 33:36.145
[SPEAKER_01]: That, that.

