33:39.569 --> 33:40.310
[SPEAKER_01]: You were there, wow.

33:40.330 --> 33:43.555
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, and then the third time, the karmachilling, the cremation.

33:44.796 --> 33:48.458
[SPEAKER_01]: This Sakyong ceremony, is it like what they do for kings, is that?

33:48.759 --> 33:48.999
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

33:49.880 --> 33:58.566
[SPEAKER_00]: I think there is a special kind of text or instruction in Rinchen Tenzu according to the Changdrei tradition.

33:59.246 --> 34:02.529
[SPEAKER_00]: And based on that, I think Khyentse Rinpoche performed the ceremony.

34:02.589 --> 34:07.092
[SPEAKER_00]: And then Trungpa Rinpoche requested Khyentse Rinpoche to do that.

34:07.112 --> 34:08.313
[SPEAKER_00]: He needed that wang.

34:09.254 --> 34:13.297
[SPEAKER_00]: So they did a big ceremony.

34:14.718 --> 34:21.162
[SPEAKER_01]: And then so you've seen Dharma change in like Tibetan Buddhism change In America over many years.

34:21.222 --> 34:23.524
[SPEAKER_01]: It would seem do you have you know?

34:23.564 --> 34:27.106
[SPEAKER_01]: What's your impression of how Dharma has changed in the West?

34:27.166 --> 34:28.047
[SPEAKER_01]: Let's call it the West.

34:28.147 --> 34:38.354
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, I think When we first came many people don't know about Tibetan Buddhism, you know, that's 1970s people know more about Hare Krishna and

34:39.474 --> 34:43.738
[SPEAKER_00]: So even when we're walking on the street with robes, people will go, hey, Hare Krishna.

34:44.338 --> 34:50.923
[SPEAKER_00]: Even sometimes at the airport, immigration, they say, oh, Khyentse Rinpoche was coming, and then they say, oh, big Hare Krishna is coming.

34:52.524 --> 34:53.525
[SPEAKER_00]: So people don't know much.

34:54.506 --> 35:08.476
[SPEAKER_00]: And also the people who attend the, I think the Trungpa Rinpoche Sangha was different because they put on suit and tie, but other places where a lot of the hippies and, you know, those people would attend the teaching.

35:09.656 --> 35:11.977
[SPEAKER_00]: And then I see the gradual changes.

35:13.598 --> 35:24.822
[SPEAKER_00]: And then now a lot of the, from the what we call mainstream, people like doctors, engineers, and especially I visit few times with His Holiness Dalai Lama's teaching, lots of scientists.

35:25.962 --> 35:31.184
[SPEAKER_00]: So I think that whole transformation, transformation, yeah, I've seen.

35:32.065 --> 35:35.850
[SPEAKER_01]: So the Dharma coming to the mainstream, science being interested.

35:35.870 --> 35:38.013
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, and doctors and engineers.

35:38.073 --> 35:42.720
[SPEAKER_00]: And now the Dharma is a very common use, widely used word.

35:43.361 --> 35:45.845
[SPEAKER_00]: I could see that it's very much adapting to it.

35:47.788 --> 36:02.968
[SPEAKER_00]: and then this I wouldn't imagine that seeing one two thousand Himalayans in New York in the one it was almost like being in Nepal yeah strong community here in New York

36:03.709 --> 36:27.929
[SPEAKER_00]: before I think when you see one Tibetan in the street like wow seeing an alien Khenpo Rinpoche went to World Trade Center that time the Twin Tower and then Rinpoche went upstairs and there was a kamatini was up there and there was a big surprise kamatini from Canada and then Khenpo Rinpoche was invited to Canada gave teaching there

36:29.420 --> 36:31.162
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, you wouldn't think you would meet there.

36:31.423 --> 36:32.164
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

36:33.545 --> 36:40.654
[SPEAKER_01]: So you think that the Dharma, I'm interested in your thoughts on how the Dharma is coming to the West and whether you think it's doing well.

36:42.617 --> 36:47.283
[SPEAKER_01]: When you come to America, what do you think is, what are you teaching and why?

36:47.623 --> 36:57.671
[SPEAKER_00]: I think Dhamma is like, I don't know whether the word right or not, but getting rooted in the West.

36:58.211 --> 37:03.135
[SPEAKER_00]: Before it was a little bit like I said, it's kind of exotic, Asian.

37:04.436 --> 37:30.838
[SPEAKER_00]: you know some kind of thing but now it's sort of becoming a main yeah becoming heavy kind of serious study and also with the science and all that i think it will also benefit even without the the labeling of the being a buddhist you know they're using the buddhist idea of loving kindness and compassion into the mainstream so i think it will continue and benefit a lot of people

37:32.606 --> 37:39.628
[SPEAKER_00]: And mainly I came because the Himalayan group here, they want to do the Paranirvana of Khyentse Rinpoche.

37:40.208 --> 37:46.370
[SPEAKER_00]: And it's nice to come because every time I come here, I meet some people saying that, oh, I know you from eight years old.

37:47.010 --> 37:49.211
[SPEAKER_00]: So, wherever I go.

37:49.531 --> 37:52.792
[SPEAKER_00]: And also being Khyentse Rinpoche's, Khyentse Rinpoche's student,

37:53.572 --> 37:54.512
[SPEAKER_00]: I could go anywhere.

37:54.893 --> 37:57.914
[SPEAKER_00]: I feel that kind of, I can feel it like a home.

37:58.134 --> 37:59.474
[SPEAKER_00]: Somehow some connection is there.

38:00.434 --> 38:05.596
[SPEAKER_00]: If I meet any Sangha member of Chögyam Trungpa, there's a strong connection with Khyentse Rinpoche.

38:06.236 --> 38:12.858
[SPEAKER_00]: And Sangha member from any other schools, somehow there's some connection with Khyentse Rinpoche.

38:12.918 --> 38:15.879
[SPEAKER_00]: So don't feel like stranger or anything.

38:16.200 --> 38:16.840
[SPEAKER_01]: Big family.

38:17.080 --> 38:19.961
[SPEAKER_01]: Khyentse Rinpoche have big family, right?

38:20.041 --> 38:20.241
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

38:20.921 --> 38:28.003
[SPEAKER_00]: And also from different schools, you know, like Pernod Rinpoche students, or nowadays there are a lot of Pernod Rinpoche students, Meanderling students.

38:28.023 --> 38:40.286
[SPEAKER_00]: So somehow we all feel, some of them I met yesterday, some ex-moms from Meanderling that we received Rinpoche Tenshi together, some from Pernod Rinpoche who received the Nyingma Kama together.

38:40.786 --> 38:43.707
[SPEAKER_00]: So somewhere, everywhere there's somehow some connection.

38:43.727 --> 38:45.868
[SPEAKER_00]: You don't feel like you're strangers anywhere.

38:48.257 --> 38:50.279
[SPEAKER_01]: And do you feel a responsibility?

38:50.679 --> 38:57.606
[SPEAKER_01]: Like, do you feel like a responsibility to help support Kensei Rinpoche's work continuing into the future?

38:57.626 --> 39:03.552
[SPEAKER_01]: Is that a heavy responsibility or how do you feel about that?

39:04.072 --> 39:06.933
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't think it's a heavy thing.

39:07.173 --> 39:15.935
[SPEAKER_00]: I think, well, if I look at my life, of course, I wouldn't be able to serve Rinpoche, but I've been with Rinpoche since I was five.

39:16.115 --> 39:20.615
[SPEAKER_00]: And then when I was like 15 or something, then I started to serve Rinpoche a little bit.

39:21.756 --> 39:23.416
[SPEAKER_00]: But still a very distracted young man.

39:25.156 --> 39:27.437
[SPEAKER_00]: When I was 25 years, Kenzo Rinpoche passed away.

39:28.838 --> 39:35.261
[SPEAKER_00]: And then that time I was a little bit struggling to continue with the monastery works and all that.

39:35.321 --> 39:41.505
[SPEAKER_00]: But somehow with Rinpoche's blessing, everything sort of falls into place.

39:42.105 --> 39:44.766
[SPEAKER_00]: And then the Yangtze, Khyentse Rinpoche Yangtze was recognized.

39:45.347 --> 39:46.988
[SPEAKER_00]: And then I served him for 20 years.

39:48.771 --> 40:03.192
[SPEAKER_00]: time goes so fast that's amazing yes 20 years I spent so I spent 20 years with previous Khyentse Rinpoche and 20 years with young Khyentse Rinpoche and between five years sort of little bit finding the reincarnation all this kind of thing

40:04.253 --> 40:13.700
[SPEAKER_00]: And then by 2010, I wanted to put a little bit more into practice because I received so much teaching and blessing from Khyentse Rinpoche.

40:13.760 --> 40:18.864
[SPEAKER_00]: But somehow, Khyentse Rinpoche made me the chairman of the Nyingma Meulam in India.

40:18.904 --> 40:21.226
[SPEAKER_00]: So I couldn't do retreat for three more years.

40:21.246 --> 40:31.594
[SPEAKER_00]: So just after third year of the responsibility of Nyingma Meulam, then I went into retreat for maybe three and a half or four years.

40:33.135 --> 40:54.032
[SPEAKER_00]: so my my hope is that to do every year at least if I can hundred days of retreat which cancer measure recommends yeah and then I'm not worried or don't feel pressure because I think when the time is right everything somehow falls into by itself blessings and when the time is right people just

40:55.333 --> 41:01.255
[SPEAKER_00]: People like, just showed up, Lama showed up to help me translate Rinpoche's teachings and all that.

41:01.275 --> 41:03.176
[SPEAKER_00]: You know, things would just come naturally.

41:04.197 --> 41:05.197
[SPEAKER_01]: This is the tendril.

41:05.237 --> 41:05.537
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

41:06.317 --> 41:11.759
[SPEAKER_00]: Never met Rinpoche, but somehow, very strong devotion, connection with Khyentse Rinpoche.

41:11.880 --> 41:12.960
[SPEAKER_00]: And he is there to help me.

41:15.313 --> 41:17.617
[SPEAKER_00]: which is Dharma practice introduced in the West.

41:18.438 --> 41:19.680
[SPEAKER_00]: And we have finished for 10 years.

41:20.501 --> 41:22.704
[SPEAKER_01]: 13 years of translating.

41:22.845 --> 41:26.310
[SPEAKER_01]: All these projects are such long-term projects, right?

41:26.410 --> 41:29.074
[SPEAKER_01]: All the projects in Dharma, you have to think long-term.

41:29.254 --> 41:30.636
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, yeah, yeah.

41:31.525 --> 41:36.927
[SPEAKER_01]: And even for you, you served Khyentse Rinpoche for 20 years and then Khyentse Yangtze for 20 years.

41:36.967 --> 41:37.328
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

41:37.668 --> 41:39.128
[SPEAKER_01]: That's a surprise.

41:39.148 --> 41:40.269
[SPEAKER_01]: You said 20 years.

41:40.809 --> 41:41.589
[SPEAKER_01]: Time is going.

41:41.669 --> 41:42.650
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, very fast.

41:42.790 --> 41:49.933
[SPEAKER_00]: And then now my main kind of thing that I want to do is that I transmit the lineage back.

41:50.213 --> 41:50.833
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

41:50.873 --> 41:54.055
[SPEAKER_00]: So many I received, and especially in Tibet.

41:54.835 --> 41:55.496
[SPEAKER_00]: In Tibet as well.

41:55.536 --> 41:56.776
[SPEAKER_00]: In Tibet.

41:56.956 --> 41:58.397
[SPEAKER_00]: A few years ago I went.

41:58.557 --> 42:00.658
[SPEAKER_00]: I gave as much as I can.

