[SPEAKER_00]: This year, I tried to go, give me Pham Kham Mung, but I didn't get permission.

42:29.927 --> 42:31.929
[SPEAKER_01]: You got Jigme Lingpa Sambung in Nepal?

42:31.949 --> 42:32.769
[SPEAKER_01]: In Nepal, yes.

42:33.009 --> 42:37.893
[SPEAKER_00]: That was quite amazing because I was very happy that a lot of people came from all over the world.

42:37.953 --> 42:40.055
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, yeah, yeah.

42:40.095 --> 42:41.255
[SPEAKER_00]: And on the internet as well.

42:41.416 --> 42:45.318
[SPEAKER_00]: Because it was cancer, which is lineage.

42:45.579 --> 42:47.040
[SPEAKER_00]: So many people, they came.

42:48.180 --> 43:08.152
[SPEAKER_00]: and I'm able to give them and then after the transmission everybody fly back to their own kind of you know home and they will continue with spreading so that's very very beautiful I feel very satisfied very satisfied with that a lot of a lot of people turned out I think the biggest ever in Sheshet Monastery you were both there right?

43:08.752 --> 43:16.797
[SPEAKER_00]: Nepal yes about six ten thousand people about 650 Lama Turku Khyambus only amazing and from the all the four different schools

