[SPEAKER_01]: And also it was on the internet, yeah?

43:20.759 --> 43:21.539
[SPEAKER_01]: They showed some.

43:21.899 --> 43:24.199
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, for Facebook and all those things.

43:24.219 --> 43:26.840
[SPEAKER_00]: But yeah, the transmission, I think... Has to be personal.

43:26.920 --> 43:27.740
[SPEAKER_00]: I think so, yeah.

43:28.741 --> 43:29.281
[SPEAKER_00]: Something like that.

43:29.321 --> 43:35.362
[SPEAKER_00]: So this is my hope, to practice a little bit and then give transmission.

