43:40.904 --> 43:44.165
[SPEAKER_00]: Because you are what number?

43:44.205 --> 43:44.505
[SPEAKER_00]: Seventh.

43:44.545 --> 43:45.325
[SPEAKER_00]: Seventh, yes.

43:46.921 --> 43:53.505
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't know much about the previous Chechen Ramja Rinpoche, but Khyentse Rinpoche was more close with Chechen Khyentse Rinpoche.

43:54.906 --> 43:59.889
