53:31.003 --> 53:36.167
[SPEAKER_01]: liberating experiences to have a little more of that stickiness, we need to stay in them.

53:36.607 --> 53:41.331
[SPEAKER_01]: On purpose, notice what they're like, rest in them, let go into them even more.

53:41.891 --> 53:54.241
[SPEAKER_01]: And that actually, what we discover is that that experience during After the Rain is more the truth of who we are than any story we've ever told about ourselves.

